return ['domain'=>'publishpress-checklists','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'yo','project-id-version'=>'PublishPress Checklists','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-01-27T14:26:22+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-11-12 14:38+0000','x-generator'=>'Weblate 5.14.3','messages'=>['PublishPress Checklists Free'=>'PublishPress Checklists Free','https://publishpress.com/'=>'https://publishpress.com/','With PublishPress Checklists, you can choose publishing requirements for your content.'=>'Pẹlu PublishPress Checklists, o le yan awọn ibeere titẹjade fun akoonu rẹ.','PublishPress'=>'PublishPress','https://publishpress.com'=>'https://publishpress.com','Disabled'=>'Ti dènà','Recommended'=>'Ti a ṣe iṣeduro','Required'=>'Ti a beere','Please correct your form errors below and try again.'=>'Jọwọ ṣatunṣe awọn aṣiṣe fọọmu rẹ ni isalẹ ki o si gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','Cheatin&#8217; uh?'=>'Ṣe o n ṣe ẹtan&#8217; bẹẹ ni?','You do not have necessary permissions to complete this action.'=>'Iwọ ko ni awọn aṣẹ pataki lati pari iṣẹ yii.','Post does not exist'=>'Ifiweranṣẹ ko si','Checklists'=>'Awọn Akojọ Ṣayẹwo','PublishPress Checklists'=>'PublishPress Checklists','If you like %s please leave us a %s rating. Thank you!'=>'Ti o ba fẹ %s jọwọ fi %s ipo silẹ fun wa. O ṣeun!','Need PublishPress Checklists Support?'=>'Ṣe o nilo Atilẹyin PublishPress Checklists?','If you need help or have a new feature request, let us know.'=>'Tí o bá nílò ìrànlọ́wọ́ tàbí ní ìbéèrè tuntun fún ẹya kan, jẹ́ kí a mọ.','Request Support'=>'Beere Atilẹyin','Detailed documentation is also available on the plugin website.'=>'Iwe-ẹri ti o ni alaye ni gbogbo wa tun wa lori oju opo wẹẹbu plugin naa.','View Knowledge Base'=>'Wo Ile-ika Ẹkọ','Actions provided by PublishPress plugins.'=>'Iṣe ti a pese nipasẹ awọn afikun PublishPress.','Discover Checklists features'=>'Ṣawari awọn ẹya Checklists','Discover native checklist configuration, custom and OpenAI tasks, publishing settings, appearance, per-post task states and active Pro/integration modules. Feature discovery grants no additional permissions.'=>'Ṣawari iṣeto akojọ aṣayan abinibi, iṣẹ-ṣiṣe aṣa ati OpenAI, awọn eto atẹjade, irisi, ipin iṣẹ-ṣiṣe fun ọkọọkan awọn ifiweranṣẹ ati awọn modulu Pro / isopọ ti n ṣiṣẹ. Ṣawari ẹya ko fun ni awọn aṣẹ afikun.','Discover checklist post types'=>'Ṣawari awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ akojọ','Read native supported post type names, labels, enabled state and configuration locks. Requires the filtered checklist management capability.'=>'Ka awọn orukọ iru ifiweranṣẹ ti a ṣe atilẹyin, awọn aami, ipo ti a mu ṣiṣẹ ati awọn idena iṣeto. Nbeere agbara iṣakoso akojọ ti a lọ lọ.','Find checklist requirements'=>'Wa awọn ibeere akojọ','Find native built-in, custom, OpenAI, duplicated and integration-specific task IDs for one post type. Includes labels, groups, configured rule and actual edition availability. Read one requirement for its exact fields and latest revision.'=>'Wa awọn ID iṣẹ-ṣiṣe abinibi, aṣa, OpenAI, atunṣe ati pataki-isopọ fun iru ifiweranṣẹ kan. Ni awọn aami, awọn ẹgbẹ, ofin ti a ṣeto ati iraye si ẹda gangan. Ka ibeere kan fun awọn aaye gangan rẹ ati atunṣe tuntun rẹ.','Read checklist requirement settings'=>'Ka awọn eto ibeere akojọ','Read one native task with exact per-post-type field names, types, choices, current settings and revision. Includes ranges, role/user selectors and labels when supported. Free Pro placeholders are unavailable for writes.'=>'Ka iṣẹ-ṣiṣe abinibi kan pẹlu awọn orukọ aaye gangan fun iru ifiweranṣẹ kọọkan, awọn iru, awọn aṣayan, awọn eto lọwọlọwọ ati atunṣe. Ni awọn iwọn, awọn aṣayan ipa / olumulo ati awọn aami nigbati a ba ṣe atilẹyin. Awọn placeholders Pro ọfẹ ko wa fun kikọ.','Discover checklist requirement choices'=>'Ṣawari awọn aṣayan ibeere akojọ','Read a bounded page of native field choices, including role/user choices and live assignable taxonomy term identifiers. Use returned values rather than inventing taxonomy IDs or names.'=>'Ka oju-iwe ti o ni ihamọ ti awọn aṣayan aaye abinibi, pẹlu awọn aṣayan ipa / olumulo ati awọn idanimọ ọrọ taxonomy ti o le jẹri laaye. Lo awọn iye ti a pada dipo ki o ṣẹda awọn IDs tabi awọn orukọ taxonomy.','Editable post; native task role/user restrictions also apply'=>'Ifiweranṣẹ ti o le ṣe atunṣe; awọn ihamọ ipa / olumulo iṣẹ-ṣiṣe abinibi tun wulo','Site configuration'=>'Iṣeto aaye ayelujara','Choose a supported post type.'=>'Yan iru ifiweranṣẹ ti a ṣe atilẹyin.','Choose a requirement from this post type\'s discovery.'=>'Yan ibeere kan lati inu iwari iru ifiweranṣẹ yii.','Native taxonomy tokens from get-requirement-choices; do not invent names.'=>'Awọn aami taxonomy abinibi lati get-requirement-choices; ma ṣe ṣẹda awọn orukọ.','Choose a discovered field.'=>'Yan aaye ti a ṣe awari kan.','You cannot list users.'=>'O ko le ṣe akojọ awọn olumulo.','You cannot access this taxonomy selector.'=>'O ko le wọle si aṣayan taxonomy yii.','The settings could not be saved; original values were restored.'=>'Awọn eto ko le jẹ fipamọ; awọn iye atilẹba ni a tunṣe.','Saving failed and recovery was incomplete. Read settings before retrying.'=>'Fipamọ kuna ati imularada ko pari. Ka awọn eto ṣaaju ki o to tun gbiyanju.','Use the exact field types returned by discovery.'=>'Lo awọn iru aaye gangan ti a pada nipasẹ iwari.','The request is too large.'=>'Beere naa tobi ju.','You do not have permission for this action.'=>'O ko ni aṣẹ fun iṣe yii.','The result is too large. Use narrower discovery or a smaller page.'=>'Abajade naa tobi ju. Lo iwari to kere tabi oju-iwe ti o kere.','The operation did not complete normally. Read the affected data before retrying; some changes may have been applied.'=>'Iṣe naa ko pari ni deede. Ka data ti o kan ṣaaju ki o to tun gbiyanju; diẹ ninu awọn iyipada le ti wa ni ohun elo.','The data could not be read. Check the active integrations before retrying.'=>'Data ko le ka. Ṣayẹwo awọn isopọ ti n ṣiṣẹ ṣaaju ki o to tun gbiyanju.','Update a checklist requirement'=>'Ṣatunkọ ibeere akojọ kan','Patch one discovered task for one post type using its latest hash. Supports native rule, ranges, selectors, role exceptions and labels. Preserves other tasks and post types. Native validation runs without simulated admin forms; dry_run previews without saving.'=>'Ṣatunkọ iṣẹ-ṣiṣe kan ti a ṣe awari fun iru ifiweranṣẹ kan nipa lilo hash tuntun rẹ. Ṣe atilẹyin ofin abinibi, awọn iwọn, awọn aṣayan, awọn iyasọtọ ipa ati awọn aami. Ṣetọju awọn iṣẹ-ṣiṣe miiran ati awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ. Ifojusi abinibi n ṣiṣẹ laisi awọn fọọmu alakoso ti a ṣe afiwe; dry_run n ṣafihan laisi fipamọ.','Update several checklist requirements'=>'Ṣatunkọ ọpọlọpọ awọn ibeere akojọ','Validate every explicit task/post-type target before one native configuration write. Each target needs its current hash. Preserves omitted configuration and accepts dry_run. Does not change post content or mark tasks completed.'=>'Ṣayẹwo gbogbo ibi-afẹde iṣẹ-ṣiṣe / iru-ifiranṣẹ ti o han ṣaaju ki o to kọ nkan iṣeto abinibi kan. Gbogbo ibi-afẹde nilo hash lọwọlọwọ rẹ. Ṣetọju iṣeto ti a kọ silẹ ati gba dry_run. Ko yi akoonu ifiweranṣẹ tabi ṣe afihan awọn iṣẹ-ṣiṣe bi a ti pari.','Create or update a custom checklist task'=>'Ṣẹda tabi ṣe imudojuiwọn iṣẹ-ṣiṣe akojọ aṣa kan','Create a custom checkbox or OpenAI instruction task for one supported post type, disabled by default, or patch a discovered existing task using its latest hash. New IDs are generated by the plugin. OpenAI tasks configure instructions only; this action does not call an AI service or certify its result.'=>'Ṣẹda iṣẹ-ṣiṣe apoti ayẹwo aṣa tabi itọsọna OpenAI fun iru ifiweranṣẹ ti a ṣe atilẹyin, ti a pa mọ ni aiyipada, tabi ṣatunkọ iṣẹ-ṣiṣe ti a ṣe awari tẹlẹ nipa lilo hash tuntun rẹ. Awọn ID tuntun ni a ṣẹda nipasẹ afikun naa. Awọn iṣẹ-ṣiṣe OpenAI n ṣeto awọn ilana nikan; iṣe yii ko pe iṣẹ AI kan tabi jẹrisi abajade rẹ.','Remove a custom checklist task'=>'Yọ iṣẹ-ṣiṣe akojọ aṣa kan','Remove a verified custom or OpenAI task from one post type using its latest hash. Other post types and historic post completion metadata are retained. Native built-in tasks are disabled through their rule rather than deleted. dry_run checks only.'=>'Yọ iṣẹ-ṣiṣe aṣa ti a fọwọsi tabi OpenAI lati inu iru ifiweranṣẹ kan nipa lilo hash tuntun rẹ. Awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ miiran ati metadata ipari ifiweranṣẹ itan ni a tọju. Awọn iṣẹ-ṣiṣe abinibi ti a ṣe sinu ni a pa mọ nipasẹ ofin wọn dipo ki o yọkuro. dry_run n ṣayẹwo nikan.','Reorder checklist tasks'=>'Tun awọn iṣẹ-ṣiṣe akojọ ṣe','Move discovered requirements into the supplied native shared order. Rule ordering is shared by post types, so this can change their default task ordering too; Appearance Priority/Alphabetical modes still apply. Uses one requirement hash from the current configuration. dry_run previews without saving.'=>'Gbe awọn ibeere ti a ṣe awari sinu aṣẹ ti a pin abinibi ti a pese. Aṣẹ ofin ni a pin nipasẹ awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ, nitorina eyi le yi aṣẹ iṣẹ-ṣiṣe aiyipada wọn pada; Awọn ipo Iru Irisi / Atojọ ni a tun lo. Lo hash ibeere kan lati iṣeto lọwọlọwọ. dry_run n ṣafihan laisi fipamọ.','Reset renamed checklist labels'=>'Tun awọn aami akojọ ti a tun orukọ ṣe','Reset native WP Admin and Editing screen task labels to their defaults. This affects all tasks/post types, preserves task titles/rules and requires manage_options. Use checklist_hash from get-plugin-settings; dry_run checks only.'=>'Tun awọn aami iṣẹ-ṣiṣe WP Admin ati Ibi ṣiṣatunkọ abinibi pada si awọn aiyipada wọn. Eyi ni ipa lori gbogbo awọn iṣẹ-ṣiṣe / awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ, n ṣetọju awọn akọle iṣẹ-ṣiṣe / ofin ati beere manage_options. Lo checklist_hash lati get-plugin-settings; dry_run n ṣayẹwo nikan.','This requirement needs its active Pro integration.'=>'Ibeere yi nilo iṣọpọ Pro rẹ ti n ṣiṣẹ.','Checklist configuration changed. Read it again.'=>'Atunṣe atokọ ti yipada. Ka a lẹẹkansi.','Enter a task title that remains non-empty after sanitization.'=>'Tẹ akọle iṣẹ kan ti o wa ni ohun ti ko ni ofo lẹhin sanitization.','You cannot select users.'=>'O ko le yan awọn olumulo.','Select an eligible user from current choices.'=>'Yan olumulo ti o ni ẹtọ lati awọn aṣayan lọwọlọwọ.','You cannot assign this taxonomy.'=>'O ko le fi taxonomy yii si.','Read current taxonomy choices before saving.'=>'Ka awọn aṣayan taxonomy lọwọlọwọ ṣaaju fipamọ.','The minimum cannot exceed a positive maximum.'=>'Minimun ko le kọja agbara to dara.','Enable Who can ignore in Settings before changing role exceptions.'=>'Mu "Tani le foju" ṣiṣẹ ni Eto ṣaaju ki o to yipada awọn iyasọtọ ipa.','Include each requirement/post-type target only once.'=>'Nilo lati fi ibeere kọọkan/tipo ifiweranṣẹ kan silẹ nikan lẹẹkan.','Choose a configured custom or OpenAI task.'=>'Yan iṣẹ aṣa kan ti a ti ṣeto tabi iṣẹ OpenAI kan.','Task kind cannot be changed. Use its discovered kind or create a new task.'=>'Iru iṣẹ ko le yipada. Lo iru rẹ ti a ti ṣe awari tabi ṣẹda iṣẹ tuntun.','Only custom and OpenAI tasks can be removed.'=>'Nikan awọn iṣẹ aṣa ati OpenAI ni a le yọkuro.','Use discovered requirement identifiers.'=>'Lo awọn idanimọ ibeere ti a ṣe awari.','Settings changed. Read them again.'=>'Awọn eto ti yipada. Ka wọn lẹẹkansi.','Enable User Roles Filter (Who can ignore)'=>'Mu Asopọ Awọn olumulo ṣiṣẹ (Tani le foju)','Show warning icon'=>'Fihan aami ikilọ','Highlight failing blocks in the editor'=>'Ṣe afihan awọn bulọọki ti n baje ni olootu','Disable the Status option when using Quick Edit'=>'Pa aṣayan Ipo nigba ti o ba n lo Ṣatunkọ Kiakia','Disable Quick Edit completely'=>'Pa Ṣatunkọ Kiakia run patapata','Disable Publish button'=>'Pa bọtini Fọwọsi run','Rename task labels'=>'Tun orukọ awọn afi iṣẹ','Checklist task sort order'=>'Iṣeto aṣẹ iṣẹ atokọ','Read Checklists settings'=>'Ka awọn eto Atokọ','Read Post Types, General, Publishing Options and Appearance settings with exact native fields, choices and revisions. Actual Pro adds available non-secret settings. OpenAI/license credentials are excluded. Requires manage_options.'=>'Ka Awọn Iru Ifiweranṣẹ, Gbogbogbo, Awọn aṣayan Ikede ati Awọn eto Iwa pẹlu awọn aaye aboriginal, awọn aṣayan ati awọn atunṣe. Awọn afikun Pro gidi ni a fi kun awọn eto ti ko ni ikọkọ. Awọn iwe-ẹri OpenAI/license ti wa ni ikọlu. Nilo manage_options.','Update Checklists settings'=>'Ṣatunkọ awọn eto Atokọ','Patch supplied discovered settings using the latest hash. Boolean inputs map to native yes/no or on/off storage; post_types is a list of enabled names. Preserves omitted settings and credentials. dry_run previews native validation without saving. Feature-specific settings retain dependency and edition gates.'=>'Ṣe afihan awọn eto ti a fi silẹ ti a ṣe awari nipa lilo hash tuntun. Awọn titẹ Boolean ma ṣe ni ibamu si ibo/ko si tabi on/off ibi ipamọ; post_types jẹ atokọ ti awọn orukọ ti a gba laaye. Nilo awọn eto ti a ko fi silẹ ati awọn iwe-ẹri. dry_run n ṣafihan idanwo aboriginal laisi fipamọ. Awọn eto pato ẹya n pa asopọ ati awọn ilẹkun ipamọ.','Enable an optional Checklists feature'=>'Mu ẹya Atokọ ti a yan ṣiṣẹ','Enable or disable one discovered optional module. Core/autoloaded modules cannot be disabled. Requires manage_options and actual module availability. Uses the latest feature inventory hash. Changes take effect in a fresh request.'=>'Mu tabi pa modulu aṣayan kan ti a ṣe awari. Awọn modulu ipilẹ/ti a fa ko le pa run. Nilo manage_options ati wiwa modulu gidi. Lo hash ọja tuntun. Awọn ayipada mu ipa ni ibeere tuntun.','Settings changed. Read them again before saving.'=>'Awọn eto ti yipada. Ka wọn lẹẹkansi ṣaaju fipamọ.','This setting requires its active integration.'=>'Ipo yi nilo iṣọpọ rẹ ti n ṣiṣẹ.','Native validation did not accept this setting.'=>'Idanwo aboriginal ko gba ipo yii.','Feature settings changed. Discover them again.'=>'Awọn eto ẹya ti yipada. Ṣawari wọn lẹẹkansi.','This core module cannot be switched through MCP.'=>'Modulu ipilẹ yii ko le yipada nipasẹ MCP.','Choose an available feature from discovery.'=>'Yan ẹya ti o wa lati iwari.','Read a post checklist'=>'Ka atokọ ifiweranṣẹ kan','Read the native checklist for an editable saved post, respecting ignored roles and active Pro status/taxonomy exclusions. Results are native server snapshots, not a guarantee about unsaved editor content or JavaScript-only checks. OpenAI calls are not performed. Includes manual completion permissions and current revision.'=>'Ka atokọ aboriginal fun ifiweranṣẹ ti a fipamọ ti a le satunkọ, bọwọ fun awọn ipa ti a foju ati ipo Pro ti n ṣiṣẹ/taxonomy ti a yọkuro. Awọn abajade jẹ awọn aworan akoko olupin aboriginal, kii ṣe iṣeduro nipa akoonu olootu ti a ko fipamọ tabi awọn idanwo JavaScript nikan. Awọn ipe OpenAI ko ṣe.','Complete or reopen manual checklist tasks'=>'Pari tabi tun ṣi awọn iṣẹ atokọ ọwọ','Set explicit boolean states for configured, enabled custom checkboxes or approvals on one editable post using its latest revision. Checks each task\'s native role/user restrictions and post-meta permission before any write. Automatic and OpenAI results cannot be forged. dry_run validates without saving.'=>'Ṣeto awọn ipo boolean ti o han gbangba fun awọn apoti ayẹwo aṣa ti a ti ṣeto, ti a mu ṣiṣẹ lori ifiweranṣẹ kan ti a le satunkọ nipa lilo atunṣe rẹ ti o kẹhin. Ṣayẹwo awọn ihamọ ipa/olumulo aboriginal ti iṣẹ kọọkan ati igbanilaaye post-meta ṣaaju eyikeyi kọ. Awọn abajade adaṣe ati OpenAI ko le jẹ ẹtan. dry_run n ṣayẹwo laisi fipamọ.','The post or checklist changed. Read it again.'=>'Ipo tabi atokọ ti yipada. Ka a lẹẹkansi.','You cannot mark this task for this post.'=>'Iwọ ko le samisi iṣẹ yii fun ifiweranṣẹ yii.','Task state could not be saved; original states were restored.'=>'Ipo iṣẹ ko le jẹ fipamọ; awọn ipo atilẹba ni a tun pada.','Task state save failed and recovery was incomplete. Read the checklist before retrying.'=>'Fipamọ ipo iṣẹ kuna ati imularada ko pari. Ka atokọ ṣaaju ki o to tun gbiyanju.','Settings'=>'Ẹ̀tọ́','Upgrade to Pro'=>'Mu si Pro','Approved by %s'=>'Ti fọwọsi nipasẹ %s','Approved by a user in this role'=>'Ti fọwọsi nipasẹ olumulo kan ni i