=>'Ko si awọn ibeere %s fun iru ifiweranṣẹ yii.','New Item'=>'Ohun Tuntun','Description'=>'Apejuwe','Custom tasks do not complete automatically. Users must check the box to show they have completed the task.'=>'Iṣẹ adani ko pari laifọwọyi. Awọn olumulo gbọdọ ṣayẹwo apoti lati fi hàn pe wọn ti pari iṣẹ naa.','Add OpenAI Prompt task'=>'Fi iṣẹ OpenAI Prompt kun','The prompt should be in form of a question.'=>'Ìmúrasílẹ̀ náà yẹ kí o jẹ́ ní fọ́ọ̀mù ìbéèrè.','This feature requires an OpenAI API Key.'=>'Àwọn ẹya yii nilo bọtini API OpenAI kan.','Latin characters in permalink'=>'Àwọn àkàrà Látínì nínú permalink','Permalinks'=>'Permalinks','Define tasks related to permalinks'=>'Ṣe alaye awọn iṣẹ ti o ni ibatan si awọn permalink','Permissions'=>'Ìmúṣẹ','Exclude User Roles'=>'Yọkuro Awọn ipa olumulo','Roles that can ignore %s'=>'Awọn ipa ti o le foju %s','Reviews'=>'Atunwo','Checklists Settings'=>'Awọn Eto Akojọ Ṣayẹwo','Are you sure you want to reset all renamed checklist items to their default labels? This action cannot be undone.'=>'Ṣe o da igbẹkẹle pe o fẹ lati tun gbogbo awọn nkan atokọ ti a tun orukọ silẹ si awọn aami aiyipada wọn? Iṣe yii ko le ṣe atunṣe.','Resetting...'=>'Tun seeto...','Reset All Renamed Labels'=>'Tun gbogbo awọn aami orukọ pada','Settings sections'=>'Awọn apakan eto','Features'=>'Awọn ẹya','Feel free to select only the features you need.'=>'Ma ṣe ṣiyemeji lati yan awọn ẹya ti o nilo nikan.','Enabled features'=>'Awọn ẹya ti a mu ṣiṣẹ','There are no PublishPress modules registered'=>'Kò sí àwọn àwùjọ PublishPress tí a forúkọsílẹ̀','Disabled because add_post_type_support(\'%1$s\', \'%2$s\') is included in a loaded file.'=>'Ti dènà nitori add_post_type_support(\'%1$s\', \'%2$s\') ti wa ninu faili kan ti a kojọpọ.','Enable User Roles Filter:'=>'Mu Asẹ Awọn ipa olumulo ṣiṣẹ:','Show warning icon:'=>'Fi aami ikilọ hàn:','Highlight failing blocks in the editor:'=>'Ṣafihan awọn bulọọki ti o kuna ni olootu:','Delete data on uninstall:'=>'Pa data nigba ti a ba yọ