ht Gutenberg blocks that fail block-specific checklist tasks.'=>'Eyi yoo ṣe afihan awọn bulọọki Gutenberg ti o kuna awọn iṣẹ atokọ pato.','When enabled, all PublishPress Checklists data will be deleted if the plugin is uninstalled.'=>'Nigbati o ba ti mu ṣiṣẹ, gbogbo data PublishPress Checklists yoo parẹ ti a ba yọ akopọ naa kuro.','This will show "Exclude User Roles" options.'=>'Eyi yoo fihan awọn aṣayan "Yọ Awọn ipa olumulo".','Disabling the "Status" option is recommended because it can be used to avoid using the Checklists requirements.'=>'Dákẹ́ àṣayan "Ipo" ni a ṣe iṣeduro nitori pe a le lo lati yago fun lilo awọn ibeere Checklists.','This will disable "Quick Edit" for all users except those with the "manage_options" capability.'=>'Eyi yóò pa "Ṣatunkọ Kánkán" fun gbogbo awọn olumulo ayafi fun awọn ti o ni agbara "manage_options".','This will disable the "Publish" button when checklist requirements are not met.'=>'Eyi yóò pa bọtini "Tẹ̀jáde" run nigbati awọn ibeere atokọ ko ba pade.','Enter your API Key to use OpenAI prompts in checklist tasks.'=>'Tẹ bọtini API rẹ lati lo awọn ibeere OpenAI ninu awọn iṣẹ akọsilẹ.','Post Types'=>'Iru Ifiweranṣẹ','General'=>'Gbogbogbo','Publishing Options'=>'Awọn aṣayan Ifiweranṣẹ','Appearance'=>'Ímúrasílẹ̀','Integration'=>'Isopọ','Tools'=>'Awọn irinṣẹ','Enter a Dashicons class name (e.g., dashicons-yes, dashicons-saved). '=>'Tẹ orúkọ kilasi Dashicons kan (àpẹẹrẹ, dashicons-yes, dashicons-saved). ','View Dashicons'=>'Wo Dashicons','Enter a Dashicons class name (e.g., dashicons-no, dashicons-dismiss). '=>'Tẹ orúkọ kilasi Dashicons kan (àpẹẹrẹ, dashicons-no, dashicons-dismiss). ','Allow admins to rename task labels for the post editor.'=>'Gba awọn alakoso laaye lati tun orukọ awọn aami iṣẹ fun olootu ifiweranṣẹ.','Default'=>'Aiyipada','Priority'=>'Pataki','Alphabetical'=>'Akọtọ','Keeps tasks in the order configured on the Checklists screen.'=>'Pa awọn iṣẹ ni aṣẹ ti a ti tunto lori iboju Atokọ.','Shows Required tasks before Recommended tasks.'=>'Fihan awọn iṣẹ ti a beere ṣaaju awọn iṣẹ ti a ṣeduro.','Sorts tasks alphabetically by task label.'=>'Ṣeto awọn iṣẹ ni akojọ nipasẹ aami iṣẹ.','This will reset all renamed checklist labels for WP Admin and Editing screen back to their default labels.'=>'Eyi yoo tun gbogbo awọn aami atokọ ti a renamed fun WP Admin ati iboju Ṣatunkọ pada si awọn aami aiyipada wọn.','Security check failed.'=>'Ìdánwò ààbò kọ́ ṣẹ́gun.','You do not have permission to perform this action.'=>'Ìwọ kò ní ìjẹ́wọ́ láti ṣe ìṣe yìí.','All renamed labels have been reset successfully.'=>'Gbogbo awọn aami ti a renamed ti tunṣe ni aṣeyọri.','Number of characters in Yoast SEO focus keyword'=>'Iye awọn ohun kikọ ninu ọrọ-ọrọ idojukọ Yoast SEO','Minimum of %d character in Yoast SEO focus keyword'=>'Kéré jùlọ ti %d àwòrán nínú ọrọ pataki Yoast SEO','Minimum of %d characters in Yoast SEO focus keyword'=>'Kere ju %d awọn ohun kikọ ninu ọrọ-ọrọ idojukọ Yoast SEO','Maximum of %d character in Yoast SEO focus keyword'=>'Max ti %d lẹta ninu Yoast SEO focus keyword','Maximum of %d characters in Yoast SEO focus keyword'=>'Maximu ti %d àwòrán nínú ọrọ pataki Yoast SEO','%d character in Yoast SEO focus keyword'=>'%d ohun kikọ ninu ọrọ-ọrọ idojukọ Yoast SEO','%d characters in Yoast SEO focus keyword'=>'%d awọn ohun kikọ ninu ọrọ-ọrọ idojukọ Yoast SEO','Between %d and %d characters in Yoast SEO focus keyword'=>'Laarin %d ati %d awọn kikọ ni ọrọ-ọrọ idojuko Yoast SEO','Number of characters in Yoast SEO meta description'=>'Iye awọn ohun kikọ ninu apejuwe meta Yoast SEO','Minimum of %d character in Yoast SEO meta description'=>'Kere ju %d ohun kikọ ninu apejuwe meta Yoast SEO','Minimum of %d characters in Yoast SEO meta description'=>'Kere ju %d awọn ohun kikọ ninu apejuwe meta Yoast SEO','Maximum of %d character in Yoast SEO meta description'=>'Max ti %d lẹta ninu Yoast SEO meta description','Maximum of %d characters in Yoast SEO meta description'=>'Maximu ti %d àwòrán nínú ìtàn meta Yoast SEO','%d character in Yoast SEO meta description'=>'%d ohun kikọ ninu apejuwe meta Yoast SEO','%d characters in Yoast SEO meta description'=>'%d awọn ohun kikọ ninu apejuwe meta Yoast SEO','Between %d and %d characters in Yoast SEO meta description'=>'Laarin %d ati %d awọn kikọ ni apejuwe meta Yoast SEO','Minimum Yoast SEO readability score'=>'Iwọn iṣiro kika Yoast SEO ti o kere ju','Yoast Readability: %s'=>'Yoast Iye kika: %s','OK'=>'Daradara','Good'=>'Daradara','Minimum Yoast SEO analysis score'=>'Iwọn iṣiro itupalẹ Yoast SEO ti o kere ju','Yoast SEO: %s'=>'Yoast SEO: %s','Define tasks related to Yoast SEO'=>'Ṣe alaye awọn iṣẹ ti o ni ibatan si Yoast SEO','This plugin can be deleted.'=>'A le pa àfikún yìí run.','You\'re using PublishPress Checklists Free. The Pro version has more features and support. %sUpgrade to Pro%s'=>'Iwọ nlo PublishPress Checklists Free. Ẹya Pro ni awọn ẹya diẹ sii ati atilẹyin. %sMu si Pro%s']];